 home:guide('Your brand, website, content or business goal.',['Choose one of the four workspaces.','Use All modules to find a specific function.','Open How it works in any module for its inputs, steps and result.'],'The same signed-in workspace, with your saved records.','Sign in with ChatGPT to save private work.',['designer','storefront-editor','digital-studio','orders']),
