 'digital-studio':guide('A laptop or phone camera, microphone and up to five camera phones.',['Start a studio room and open the pairing links on your phones.','Allow camera/microphone access and choose a preview camera.','Use Take to move the preview into Programme.','Record and save the programme, or check the configured uplink before broadcasting.'],'A local programme preview and saved recording; a broadcast only when the uplink succeeds.','Device permissions, compatible browser and a working network. External broadcasting needs an authorized uplink.',['camera','voice','media-library','social-campaigns']),
